    "这是按 v1.15.0 控制流制作的教学模拟。example.com/* 为虚构模块；浏览器不执行 Go。真实上游例子见动画后的“源码里的同类情况”。": "A teaching simulation of v1.15.0 control flow. example.com/* modules are fictional; the browser does not execute Go. See \"Similar cases in the source\" after the animation for real upstream examples.",
