    "保存规则，然后启动带 toolexec 的构建：它在编译工具执行前接入改写。这里才会把前后动作接到目标函数。": "Save the rules, then start a build with toolexec, which performs rewriting before invoking the compilation tool. This is where before/after actions connect to target functions.",
    "前面解决“代码能不能找到”，这里解决“在目标函数什么位置调用它”。": "Earlier steps made code discoverable; this step determines where the target function calls it.",
