    "编译时准备代码；运行时调用代码": "Prepare code at compile time; call it at runtime",
    "现在回看三轮：选出规则 → 补入代码 → 构建范围变化 → 重新选 → 补齐最终结果。": "Review the three rounds: select rules -> add code -> build scope changes -> select again -> complete the final inputs.",
    "关键不在重复次数，而在依赖先后：newDeps 处理上次匹配的结果。两次匹配，前后需要安排三次准备。": "The key is dependency order, not repetition count: newDeps processes the previous match's result. Two matches require three preparation passes arranged before, between, and after them.",
    "只准备一轮会怎样？": "What if preparation stops after one round?",
    "停在第一次匹配后，看看缺什么。": "Stop after the first match and see what is missing.",
    "试着只做一轮：缺了 room-recorder": "Try one round: room-recorder is missing",
    "第 1 轮是“准备基础库 → 匹配出 room 规则”。循环结束时，room 记录包还没有经过依赖准备。": "Round 1 prepares base libraries, then matches the room rule. When the loop ends, the room recording package has not undergone dependency preparation.",
    "newDeps 在 matchRules 前面执行；本轮新选出的规则，只能在下一轮才被 newDeps 处理。": "newDeps runs before matchRules. A rule newly selected in this round can only be processed by newDeps in the next round.",
    "把循环展开成实际顺序 · 伪代码": "Expand the loop into execution order: pseudocode",
