    "如果第二次匹配没有任何相关变化，有的项目两轮可能就够；当前代码没有做这种提前结束的判断。": "If the second match makes no relevant changes, two rounds might suffice for some projects. The current code has no early-exit check for this case.",
    "第二次匹配可能产生新的记录包需求，第三次准备负责落实。当前代码固定三轮，没有检测是否还会继续出现新规则。": "The second match may require new recording packages; the third preparation supplies them. The current code fixes the count at three rounds and does not check whether further new rules would appear.",
    "第二次匹配选出了 cache 规则，为什么后面还要调用 newDeps？": "The second match selected the cache rule. Why call newDeps afterward?",
    "要把新选中规则的记录包接入构建": "To connect the newly selected rule's recording package to the build",
