    "代码与模块名是教学片段，省略完整 hook 签名与桥接；真实工具写入的路径和版本由源码计算。浏览器仅演示变化。": "Code and module names are teaching examples with full hook signatures and bridging omitted. The real tool computes paths and versions from source. The browser only illustrates changes.",
